  "description": "HIDZIG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C134 H138 Ho4 N18 O16. From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.634-3.916 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.65-112.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C134H138N18O16Ho4.",
